0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 650 Td (Unix-style metadata. This reference uses Linux v2.6.32 ext2 definitions rather) Tj ET
0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 636 Td (than contemporary ext4 fields.) Tj ET
