0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 570 Td (flags, not its supplied label. Ext3 shares ordinary allocation, mapping and) Tj ET
0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 556 Td (directory semantics but adds different interruption guarantees.) Tj ET
